      "title": "Values in life and literature : a comparative reading of the depiction of disintegration, insecurity and uncertainty in selected novels by Thomas Mann, William Faulkner and Thomas Pynchon",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Magdalena Friedericke Wilke",
